Forwarding Base44's latest public announcement, summarized for diligence.

Base44 has reached $200M ARR, 5 months after hitting $100M, per founder Maor Shlomo (August 20, 2026).
Base44 has reached $200M ARR and more than 10 million users, per Wix CEO Avishai Abrahami.
Base44 passed $100 million ARR in March 2026, which Shlomo called the fastest with no VC backing, with 5 million users at the time.
Wix acquired Base44 in June 2025 for initial consideration of approximately $80 million plus additional earn-out payments paid through 2029.
Base44 had B2B partnerships with eToro and SimilarWeb at the time of the acquisition.
Maor Shlomo is CEO and founder of Base44.

